sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Claude as Claude Code
  participant Emit as herdr-mermaid emit
  participant Daemon as herdr-mermaid daemon
  participant Herdr as herdr

  User->>Claude: ask for a diagram
  Claude->>Emit: diagram source (.mmd)
  Emit-->>Claude: padded mermaid block
  Claude->>User: message ending with the block
  Daemon->>Daemon: tail the transcript, render with Chrome
  loop every 50 ms
    Daemon->>Herdr: pane.read (visible text)
    Daemon->>Herdr: pane.graphics.stream frame at the block's row
  end
  Herdr-->>User: picture drawn over the block
